---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'June 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of Use for pechgroup.com — Pech Group's website terms covering permitted use, disclaimers, and limitations."
>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section__label">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="page-header__sub">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-content">

      <div class="legal-notice">
        <strong>Notice:</strong> These Terms of Use should be reviewed by qualified legal counsel
        before the website is made publicly available. They are provided as a starting draft only.
      </div>

      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using pechgroup.com (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of
        Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>2. About the Site</h2>
      <p>
        This Site is operated by Pech Group, a boutique executive advisory firm. The Site is
        provided for informational purposes only and does not constitute an offer to provide
        professional services.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Permitted Use</h2>
      <p>You may use the Site to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Learn about Pech Group's services and capabilities</li>
        <li>Contact us regarding potential engagements</li>
        <li>Access publicly available content and insights</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You may not use the Site to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Scrape, harvest, or extract data for commercial purposes</li>
        <li>Reproduce or redistribute content without permission</li>
        <li>Engage in any activity that may harm the Site, its users, or Pech Group</li>
        <li>Misrepresent your identity or affiliation</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. No Professional Advice</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this Site is for general informational purposes only. Nothing on this Site
        constitutes legal, financial, investment, or professional advisory services. Pech Group's
        advisory services are provided only under a signed engagement agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>5. AI-Related Content</h2>
      <p>
        Descriptions of AI and autonomous agent capabilities on this Site reflect general
        capabilities of our services. Pech Group makes no guarantees regarding specific outcomes,
        performance levels, or results from the use of AI agents. All AI-related content is
        capability-honest and does not include fabricated case studies or client testimonials.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on this Site — including text, design, graphics, and code — is owned by
        Pech Group or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
        You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without prior written consent.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. Pech Group
        does not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or
        other harmful components.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, Pech Group shall not be liable for any indirect,
        incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of or
        inability to use the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of California, without regard to its
        conflict of law provisions.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms at any time. The "Last updated" date reflects the most recent
        revision. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these Terms? Contact us at
        <a href="mailto:pech@pechgroup.com">pech@pechgroup.com</a>.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
  }
  .page-header h1 { color: var(--white); margin: 0.5rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .page-header__sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .legal-content { max-width: 760px; }
  .legal-notice {
    background: rgba(202,173,135,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(202,173,135,0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(1,8,45,0.07);
  }
  .legal-content h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; border-top: none; }
  .legal-content p { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .legal-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal-content ul li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .legal-content a { color: var(--gold-dark); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
